_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Pourrais-je emprunter ton t\u00e9l\u00e9phone ?<br/> <span class = \"strong\">Jade </span> : Oui, pas de probl\u00e8me !", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Tu es la meilleure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "utilis\u00e9 pour parler de quelqu'un qu'on appr\u00e9cie plus que tout", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : <br/><span class=\"strong\">Anne</span> : Je peux m'occuper de tes chats.  </br> <span class=\"strong\">Catherine </span> : Tu es la meilleure.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Ce sont les mots que vous entendez dans les conversations entre amis.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "faire le tour du monde", "type": "name"}, {"content": "voyager dans de nombreux pays", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je r\u00eave de faire le tour du monde.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la valise", "type": "name"}, {"content": "bagage o\u00f9 l'on met ses  v\u00eatements quand on voyage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ai d\u00fb acheter une nouvelle valise pour aller en voyage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "il para\u00eet que", "type": "name"}, {"content": "on dit que", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(locution)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il para\u00eet que tu as gagn\u00e9 au loto.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gagner"